{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026CiJEhFKBZu1793186717.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>瑞士室內網球賽，華連卡完成最後一戰，首圈止步，結束24年職業生涯。</p><p></p><p>華連卡獲發外卡，在主場上演告別戰。這位三項大滿貫得主，面對八號種子列克卡，第六局有兩個破發分，但未能把握，尾段失守之下，先輸5-7。</p><p></p><p>世界排名最高上過第三，41歲的華連卡表示，在主場最後一戰感覺圓滿，已拼盡所有，無遺憾。</p><p></p><p>第二盤成功保發，打到決勝局，但招牌反手打出界，輸「細分」2-7，正式告別賽場。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-28T12:01:19.470841+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":184,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-28T11:24:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-28T18:38:54.085142+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-28T11:58:28.995238+00:00","content_hash":"13abf3a5a4e18db8b723a957c187d27029896b70dee05cff80f4fc092e338c5f","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}